adk_tracegauge: google-adk==2.12.0 is newer than the newest release this adk-tracegauge version was tested against (tested: 2.6.0 <= version < 2.12.0). Continuing; this is expected to work, and CI checks the newest google-adk daily. If something misbehaves, upgrade adk-tracegauge or report it at https://github.com/gaurav-gandhi-2411/adk-tracegauge/issues
adk-tracegauge quickstart -- no API key, no network call, no ADK app of your own.
Running a deterministic, in-memory demo agent through a real InMemoryRunner,
twice (32 toy cases each), with a deliberate cost regression injected
into the second run, then firing the real `adk-tracegauge check` gate.

adk-tracegauge check: mode=paired (key=session_id, 32 overlapping session_ids matched between baseline and current)
